     <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">A distinctive photographed design</div><h1>White checked lungis. One bold blue border.</h1><p class="lead">A restrained checked white design finished with a clearly visible blue edge. Show this photographed style when discussing your wholesale buying requirement.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="https://wa.me/14793201970?text=Hello%20Podaturpet%20Team%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20white%20checked%20lungis%20with%20a%20blue%20border.%20Approximate%20quantity%3A%20____%20Destination%3A%20____%0AReference%3A%20PT-BB-02" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask about blue border lungis</a><a class="button" href="/?product=PT-BB-02#quick-quote">Complete buyer enquiry</a></div></div><div class="photo-frame"><img class="hero-image" src="images/newphoto2.jpeg" alt="Original photograph of a white checked lungi showing fine blue-grey grid lines and a bright blue woven border" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="808" height="1003" srcset="/images/responsive/newphoto2-480.webp 480w, /images/responsive/newphoto2-800.webp 800w, /images/newphoto2.jpeg 808w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 92vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 560px"></div></section>
     <section class="section"><h2>Why the border matters.</h2><p class="intro">The photographed lungi combines fine intersecting checks with a brighter blue band at its edge. For buyers comparing similar white designs, the border colour, border width and overall check spacing are useful details to specify early.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3>Recognisable blue edge</h3><p>The visible blue border gives the otherwise light checked design a stronger identifying detail.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Light grid pattern</h3><p>Narrow blue and grey intersecting lines create a more understated appearance across the white fabric.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Photographed reference</h3><p>Use the real product photo to explain the style you want; ask about exact matching and availability.</p></article></div></section>
