     <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Global design study · 2026</div><h1>The lungi, <em>reimagined.</em></h1><p class="lead">A new utility-led direction for customers in the USA, Canada, UK, Europe and beyond—combining woven identity with secure closures, useful pockets and styling for travel, leisure and city life.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#collection">See 14 concepts</a><a class="button alt" href="https://wa.me/14793201970?text=Hello%20Podaturpet%20Team%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20share%20feedback%20or%20discuss%20the%20Global%20Modern%20Lungi%20concept." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp feedback</a></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-global-city.webp" alt="Modern utility lungi styling concept for a global city" width="1500" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="concept-tag">Original concept visual</div></div></div></section>
     <section><div class="container"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">What changes for a global audience</div><h2>Familiar comfort. More everyday confidence.</h2><p>These ideas explore how the lungi could fit more wardrobes without losing its woven character.</p></div><div class="features"><div class="feature"><b>Adjustable waist</b><span>A simple buckle or elastic system for easier sizing.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Secure closure</b><span>Snaps help reduce worry while walking or travelling.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Zipped pocket</b><span>A protected space for a phone, card or keys.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Optional inner short</b><span>Added coverage for movement and active use.</span></div></div></div></section>
