     <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Global Modern Lungi Innovation Initiative</div><h1>Help take the lungi <em>into its next era.</em></h1><p class="lead">We are seeking strategic investors, textile researchers, fashion designers, product engineers and international market partners to research, prototype and test modern lungi concepts for global lifestyles.</p><p class="tamil" lang="ta">உலக சந்தைக்கு ஏற்ற நவீன லுங்கி வடிவங்களை ஆராய்ச்சி செய்து, மாதிரிகள் உருவாக்கி, சோதனை செய்து அறிமுகப்படுத்த முதலீட்டாளர்கள், ஆராய்ச்சியாளர்கள், வடிவமைப்பாளர்கள் மற்றும் வணிகக் கூட்டாளர்கள் தேவை.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#join">Become a partner</a><a class="button alt" href="/modern-lungi-global-collection.html">View design concepts</a></div></div><div><div class="hero-images"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-global-city.webp" alt="Global modern lungi design concept" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-feature-details.webp" alt="Modern lungi functional feature concepts" width="1312" height="1199" decoding="async"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-airport-travel.webp" alt="Modern lungi travel concept" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"></div><p class="tag">Original exploratory visuals created for this initiative.</p></div></div></section>
     <section id="partners"><div class="container"><div class="head"><div class="kicker">Collaboration call</div><h2>More than funding: we need the right minds and markets.</h2><p>This project is designed as a practical research-to-market collaboration, bringing Podaturpet weaving knowledge together with global product thinking. <a href="/modern-lungi-product-innovation.html" style="color:#17694f;font-weight:900">Explore the Modern Lungi product innovations →</a></p></div><div class="partner-grid"><article class="partner"><b>Strategic Investors</b><p>Support structured research, prototyping, testing and responsible market development.</p><small>Capital + business guidance</small></article><article class="partner"><b>Textile Researchers</b><p>Explore fibres, breathability, durability, wash performance and responsible material options.</p><small>Material science + testing</small></article><article class="partner"><b>Fashion Designers</b><p>Develop inclusive silhouettes, modern checks, closures and styling for different climates.</p><small>Design + wearability</small></article><article class="partner"><b>Product Engineers</b><p>Refine adjustable waists, snaps, secure pockets, inner coverage and convertible construction.</p><small>Function + manufacturability</small></article><article class="partner"><b>Global Distributors</b><p>Provide country-specific buyer insight and help validate retail positioning and demand.</p><small>Market access + feedback</small></article><article class="partner"><b>Universities &amp; Labs</b><p>Collaborate on documented trials, user studies, sustainability and textile innovation.</p><small>Evidence + research partnership</small></article></div></div></section>
     <section class="why"><div class="container why-grid"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-reversible.webp" alt="Convertible modern lungi shown in long and short styles" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div><div class="head"><div class="kicker">The research opportunity</div><h2>One woven idea. Many climates, bodies and lifestyles.</h2><p>Research will focus on real user needs—not changing the lungi only for appearance.</p></div><div class="points"><div class="point"><b>Inclusive fit</b><span>Adjustable sizing and comfortable forms for more customers.</span></div><div class="point"><b>Climate-ready materials</b><span>Breathable, layered and season-specific options for warm and cold regions.</span></div><div class="point"><b>Everyday function</b><span>Secure closure, usable pockets, movement and easy care.</span></div><div class="point"><b>Cultural respect</b><span>Modernisation that preserves the garment’s woven identity and origin story.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
