     <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Modern Lungi product concepts · 2026</div><h1>Traditional comfort. <em>Modern function.</em></h1><p class="lead"><strong>Modern Lungi</strong> is an exploratory convertible-lungi direction designed to retain woven identity while making fit, movement, storage and climate use easier for a wider global audience.</p><p class="tamil" lang="ta"><strong>நவீன லுங்கி:</strong> பாரம்பரிய அழகை பாதுகாத்து, இன்றைய வாழ்க்கைக்கு ஏற்ற வகையில் ஒரே லுங்கியை ஐந்து விதமாகப் பயன்படுத்தும் புதிய தயாரிப்பு யோசனை.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#five-modes">Explore the concepts</a><a class="button alt" href="/modern-lungi-global-collection.html">View the visual collection</a></div></div><div class="hero-image"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-reversible.webp" alt="Modern Lungi long and short wearing mode concept" width="1500" height="1000" decoding="async"><div class="hero-badge">Original exploratory concept</div></div></div></section>
     <section id="five-modes"><div class="container"><div class="head"><div class="kicker">Core product direction</div><h2>Modern Lungi: five modes in one adaptable garment.</h2><p>The wearer chooses the mode that suits the moment, instead of needing a completely different garment.</p></div><div class="modes"><article class="mode"><small>MODE 01</small><h3>Classic</h3><p>Traditional full-length drape for familiar comfort.</p></article><article class="mode"><small>MODE 02</small><h3>City</h3><p>Secure snap closure for walking and daily movement.</p></article><article class="mode"><small>MODE 03</small><h3>Active</h3><p>Fold-and-fasten knee length with optional inner coverage.</p></article><article class="mode"><small>MODE 04</small><h3>Travel</h3><p>Protected phone, passport and key storage.</p></article><article class="mode"><small>MODE 05</small><h3>Cold Climate</h3><p>Optional removable lining for layered winter styling.</p></article></div></div></section>
     <section class="feature-section"><div class="container feature-layout"><img src="images/modern-lungi/modern-lungi-feature-details.webp" alt="Adjustable waist, snap, zipper pocket and inner short concepts" loading="lazy" width="1312" height="1199" decoding="async"><div><div class="head"><div class="kicker">Functional foundation</div><h2>Designed around confidence, not novelty alone.</h2><p>The strongest first prototype combines a small number of features that solve real customer concerns.</p></div><div class="feature-list"><div class="feature"><b>FitLock waist</b><span>Soft adjustment with side buckle and secure snaps.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Supported pockets</b><span>Zipped storage designed to reduce pulling at the waist.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Optional inner shorts</b><span>Detachable coverage for active and public use.</span></div><div class="feature"><b>Length conversion</b><span>Hidden fasteners switch full length to knee length.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
