     <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">For local textile businesses</div><h1>Your weaving story deserves <span>to be discovered.</span></h1><p class="lead">If you operate a textile, weaving or lungi-supply business connected with the Podaturpet region, tell us about your work and start a conversation about a possible sourcing or listing opportunity.</p></div><img class="hero-photo" src="images/lungi-patterns.jpeg" alt="Original photograph of traditional checked lungi designs associated with Podaturpet textile sourcing" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1332" height="1178" srcset="/images/responsive/lungi-patterns-480.webp 480w, /images/responsive/lungi-patterns-800.webp 800w, /images/responsive/lungi-patterns-1200.webp 1200w, /images/lungi-patterns.jpeg 1332w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 92vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 560px"></section>
     <section class="section"><h2>Who can introduce their business?</h2><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3>Weavers and textile producers</h3><p>Share the products, techniques and sourcing capabilities your actual business can support.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Lungi suppliers and wholesalers</h3><p>Explain your product categories, service area and the type of buyer enquiries you welcome.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Related local businesses</h3><p>Tell us about textile trading, finishing, packing or other genuine local business activities.</p></article></div></section>
     <section class="section" id="supplier-enquiry"><div class="enquiry"><div><div class="eyebrow">Start with accurate details</div><h2>Introduce your business.</h2><p>For a supplier introduction or advertising enquiry, share your business location, product range and photographs you have permission to publish. Tell us whether you want a business listing, a product promotion or a buyer introduction. We will discuss placement, timing and any charges before publication.</p><p class="lead">This form prepares a WhatsApp message. It does not create a public listing or guarantee approval, verification or customer enquiries.</p></div><form class="form" id="supplier-enquiry-form"><label class="field">Business name<input name="business_name" placeholder="Your actual business name" required></label><label class="field">Business type<select name="business_type" required><option value="">Select your activity</option><option>Handloom weaving</option><option>Powerloom weaving</option><option>Lungi supplier or wholesaler</option><option>Textile trading</option><option>Other local business</option></select></label><label class="field">Business location<input name="location" placeholder="Town or operating area" required></label><label class="field">Products or services<input name="products" placeholder="For example: checked lungi designs" required></label><label class="field full">Additional details <span style="font-weight:500;color:#65746c">(optional)</span><textarea name="details" placeholder="Products, business background or questions about a possible listing"></textarea></label><button class="submit" type="submit">Send Business Introduction on WhatsApp</button><p class="note">Your information is shared only when you choose to send the WhatsApp message. A future listing would require accurate business details and a separate review.</p></form></div></section>
